# Keep the build context small. Note what is NOT here: **/dist.
#
# The sibling repos (insurance-portal-core, levels-of-ai-help) do exclude it, because they compile
# their frontend inside the image. This one does not - the SPA is built on the host and copied in
# (see the note at the top of docker/Dockerfile) - so excluding dist/ would silently produce an
# image with no user interface.
**/node_modules
**/target
.git
.idea
**/.mvn
infra/.env
